{"unit_id":"Cloud-J__dsh-chat-jumper#feature-1","repo":"Cloud-J/dsh-chat-jumper","commit":"2f1e61c26b394ad4e57a23724be1f4a6885c34f1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Jumper 的功能「圆点定位提问」：圆点按会话快照中的顺序对应 user 和 steering 提问，点击后平滑滚动到相应消息。实现通过消息 key 查找聊天锚点；目标尚未出现在页面时会加载更早消息并重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:291-299"]}
{"unit_id":"Cloud-J__dsh-chat-jumper#feature-2","repo":"Cloud-J/dsh-chat-jumper","commit":"2f1e61c26b394ad4e57a23724be1f4a6885c34f1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Jumper 的功能「提问预览与阅读位置」：每个圆点提供截断到 40 个字符的提问预览；插件根据滚动位置高亮当前附近的提问，便于在长对话中辨认位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:20-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Cloud-J__dsh-chat-jumper#feature-3","repo":"Cloud-J/dsh-chat-jumper","commit":"2f1e61c26b394ad4e57a23724be1f4a6885c34f1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Jumper 的功能「加载更早历史」：当会话快照还有更早消息时显示加载按钮。首次点击加载一页，后续可连续加载；点击未渲染的旧提问圆点也会自动加载并重新定位。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:319-385"]}
{"unit_id":"Cloud-J__dsh-chat-jumper#feature-4","repo":"Cloud-J/dsh-chat-jumper","commit":"2f1e61c26b394ad4e57a23724be1f4a6885c34f1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Jumper 的功能「调整导航列位置」：用户可在页面右侧和对话区左侧之间切换圆点列位置；选择会存入浏览器 localStorage，并依据聊天列宽计算位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:71-85"]}
